{"id":"643344","name":"青椒肥肠炒河粉","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/643344/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"河粉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"肥肠","amount":"100g"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"凤尾","amount":"100g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"河粉用温水泡散洗净。","img":"images/643344/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"凤尾洗净切成小碎块。","img":"images/643344/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"油热以后，放入肥肠和青椒煸炒香。","img":"images/643344/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入凤尾碎翻炒。","img":"images/643344/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"凤尾变色后，放入河粉翻炒。","img":"images/643344/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/643344/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入盐和老干妈，已经生抽翻炒均匀。","img":"images/643344/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/643344/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"一筷子肥肠和河粉，香呀！","img":"images/643344/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}